" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:DEN_TunnelStaff+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd></dl>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\"> Special </span></h3>\n<p><b>The holder of this item gains:</b>\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Fly_Trap\" title=\"Fly Trap\">Fly Trap</a></dt><dd>Chance to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ensnared_(Ensnaring_Strike)_(Condition)\" title=\"Ensnared (Ensnaring Strike) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ensnare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ensnared_(Ensnaring_Strike)_(Condition)\" title=\"Ensnared (Ensnaring Strike) (Condition)\">Ensnare</a> target if it is not a plant or a beast.</dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Weapon_actions\"> Weapon actions </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <i>If you have <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a>, equip in <strong>main hand</strong> to gain:</i>\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Topple\" title=\"Topple\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Topple_Icon.webp/40px-Topple_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Topple_Icon.webp/60px-Topple_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Topple_Icon.webp/80px-Topple_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Topple\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Topple_Icon.webp/40px-Topple_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Topple_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Topple\" title=\"Topple\">Topple</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Swipe at a creature to knock it <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Underground_Passage\" title=\"Underground Passage\">Underground Passage</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-425&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-200</span>: In a trapped <a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Chest\" title=\"Heavy Chest\">Heavy Chest</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Fly Trap:</i></p>\n<ul><li>In addition to the combat round, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ensnared_(Ensnaring_Strike)_(Condition)\" title=\"Ensnared (Ensnaring Strike) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ensnare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Ensnaring_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ensnared_(Ensnaring_Strike)_(Condition)\" title=\"Ensnared (Ensnaring Strike) (Condition)\">Ensnare</a> also loses a turn of duration at the beginning of the target's turn. Therefore, Fly Trap can prevent an opponent from moving for <i>one</i> turn at most.</li>\n<li>Piercing damage from Ensnare is applied each turn regardless of whether the save fails or succeeds.</li>\n<li>There are three different kinds saves:\n<ul><li>The first is when the condition is applied. The DC for this is 12.</li>\n<li>The second is at the beginning of the victim's first turn after receiving the condition. The DC for this is Spell save DC. The condition ends if save succeeds.</li>\n<li>The third is at the beginning of the possible second turn, but this one is redundant, because the condition always ends at the start of the second round (see bugs below) regardless of whether the save fails or succeeds. The DC for this is Spell save DC.</li></ul></li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Sharpened_Snare\" title=\"Sharpened Snare\">Sharpened Snare</a> passive feature from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sharpened_Snare_Cuirass\" title=\"Sharpened Snare Cuirass\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Hide_Armour_PlusTwo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sharpened_Snare_Cuirass\" title=\"Sharpened Snare Cuirass\">Sharpened Snare Cuirass</a> affects the second and third save but not the first one.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 302px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 300px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Nature%27s_Snare_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Appearance in game\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Nature%27s_Snare_ingame.png/450px-Nature%27s_Snare_ingame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Nature%27s_Snare_ingame.png/675px-Nature%27s_Snare_ingame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/26/Nature%27s_Snare_ingame.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Appearance in game\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Nature%27s_Snare_ingame.png/450px-Nature%27s_Snare_ingame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Nature%27s_Snare_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Appearance in game</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714194643\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.104 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.111 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3682/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 60534/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12884/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 970/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.030/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1454095/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   91.363      1 Template:WeaponPage\n100.00%   91.363      1 -total\n 25.72%   23.499     41 Template:Trim\n 19.95%   18.228     11 Template:Icon_text\n 13.99%   12.786      3 Template:Uid\n 11.54%   10.544      2 Template:Damage_info\n 11.00%   10.053      5 Template:Icon_link\n 10.01%    9.148      2 Template:Damage_info/primitive\n  9.26%    8.462      4 Template:Damage_colour\n  8.39%    7.667      6 Template:Main_namespace_only\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:3385-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714194643 and revision id 390775. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}